  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"DirectedEdge", "[", 
    RowBox[{"u", ",", " ", "v"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", "x"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c3f0752a-ec18-4f21-8968-dcba0a0cb739"],
 " read antisymmetrically. A missing key counts as 0. A head with a ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Function\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d984a2ac-840e-4ebb-885b-a894a578a8a5"],
